{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChLPfbzgwLiPjoDzfCGf6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the bug: with symbolic indices, the sum of an identity matrix's elements now comes out as `n` instead of 0. With a concrete size it simplifies all the way: setting `n=3` gives `3`. With `n` left symbolic, though, `.doit()` leaves the outer sum unevaluated:\n\n```\nSum(Piecewise((1, (0 <= j) & (j <= n - 1)), (0, True)), (j, 0, n - 1))\n```\n\nThat expression is mathematically equal to `n`, since `j` always falls in that range, but SymPy doesn't reduce the outer sum to the bare `n`. If you need that exact form, it would take a separate change to how sums are evaluated.\n\n**Cause:** `Identity._entry` in `sympy/matrices/expressions/matexpr.py` checked `i == j`. For two different symbols `i` and `j` that comparison is `False`, so `e[i, j]` was always 0 and the double sum came out as 0.\n\n**Fix:** `_entry` now returns `1` when `Eq(i, j)` is definitely true, `0` when it is definitely false, and `KroneckerDelta(i, j)` otherwise. I added the `Eq` and `KroneckerDelta` imports to support this.\n\n**Checks:**\n- The script from the issue still prints `I 1 0 0 1` for the entries, `e[i, j]` is now `KroneckerDelta(i, j)`, and the diagonal sum is still `n`.\n- In `sympy/matrices/expressions`, 122 tests pass and 2 fail (`test_slice.py::test_symmetry` and `test_trace.py::test_rewrite`). Both fail the same way on the original code, so this change didn't cause them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":411,"cache_read_input_tokens":22239,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":411},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b06b3494-813c-47c3-8b7c-455a6f31b606","uuid":"04fb19a6-8cd7-42d1-aa2e-5e0fb995493b","timestamp":"2026-11-23T19:12:59.707Z","request_id":"req_011ChLPfbq1GEq5BZoUDLRXf"}
